        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/TO_0000227"/>
        <oboInOwl:id>TO:0020103</oboInOwl:id>
        <ns4:IAO_0000115>A root length (TO:0000227) trait which is the length of an adventitious root (shoot-borne root; PO:0000042).</ns4:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment>An adventitious root can be a &#39;shoot-borne root&#39; (PO:0000042) or one of the child terms- all have adventitious root as a broad synonym. Shoot-borne roots are part of the root system (PO:0025025).</rdfs:comment>
